// Three crops of the school's real "Relatorio Mensal de Aulas" template
// image, used as full-bleed backgrounds with real data overlaid on top
// (see monthly-report-document.tsx) instead of redrawing the design from
// scratch. Only the "Detalhamento das aulas" row data is code-drawn, since
// the real table has a variable number of rows a fixed image can't fit.
// Inlined as base64 strings (not files under public/ or a server asset
// path) so they always ship with the JS bundle regardless of Vercel
// serverless file-tracing.

